---
manual: edit_box.change
lines: [3038, 3042]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $seen = []
  @box = edit_box
  @box.change { $seen << @box.text }
end
----------- test code
assert_empty $seen

edit_box.trigger_change("a")
edit_box.trigger_change("ab")
edit_box.trigger_change("a")

assert_equal %w[a ab a], $seen, "the change block runs when a character is added and when one is removed"
